      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Mitsuko entered her high school with only one goal in mind: make some
    friends! Growing up, she was always absorbed in her books and never made a genuine
    friend. However, when her loneliness led her to catch feelings for a friend of
    her parents, she knew things had to change. After just her 1st year, she already
    had <b>Ninomae Arisa</b> and <b>Kishida Mie</b> by her side. But with Arisa as
    her best friend, could she be yearning for something more?'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 82abf587aec7f1b439a4ac0c432f2e7a, type: 2}
