  m_text: Going into their 3rd year, the sisters had gone their separate ways. Bad
    blood had grown between Haruko and Katsuko, leading her to find a partner of
    her own. While Haruko and Mitsuko experienced challenges with their own relationships,
    Katsuko remained in the background. After feeling changes in their environment
    as a result of their split, they'd realise that they might've been better together
    after all.
