  m_text: Haruko began high school with a mission to ensure all her sisters graduate.
    But in her 2nd year, her focus shifted when Yuri assigned her to a pair project
    with a boy named <b>Sagawa Kaito</b>. Despite first impressions, a bond began
    to form beyond their assignment when they learned they weren't so different.
    Soon, she'd find that a new path with this boy had opened for her.
