      m_Calls: []
  m_text: The tension she felt raising her daughters settled as they grew older.
    Getting calls from teachers became routine. Eventually, she decided to focus
    all her care into raising her son, Yuuchi, to ensure he grows to be an upstanding
    person. She wanted to show him more kindness, too. While his grades were good
    and he rarely got into trouble, she'd come to realise that she might never feel
    secure about her parenting.
