  m_text: '<u>14/6/2026</u>

    - New WebGL website made public

    - New website
    features and updated information

    - Volume 0 Complete Version released

    -
    Main "Toranoko!" project put on hiatus. No new major projects to be undertaken
    for the foreseeable future. Please read the "Volume 0 Release" newsletter for
    more information.

    - <b>Follow my socials and check out my smaller art pieces!</b>'
