  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The road of adulthood began with a strong start. Shortly after graduating
    from Ohashi High School, Taiga found stable employment to support their once
    small family of three. When she  announced her pregnancy, everyone around her
    could barely contain their excitement. They even had a new home being prepared
    to move into. Their days were mostly filled with joy and peace.


    However,
    it all changed when Taiga''s daughters arrived. Without access to urgent care,
    she was forced to give birth to all three of them. The excruciating pain of childbirth,
    intensified by her babies'' unusually large size and lengthened by how many she
    was carrying, left her terribly ill and disabled. After 20 years, she never fully
    recovered. They were a barrage of meteors glistening like stars in the sky.


    While
    they successfully pulled themselves safely out of the wreckage, new challenges
    arose. Ryuuji had to take on the role of stay-at-home dad. He seemed to adjust
    quickly. Taiga''s journey, on the other hand, was not as smooth. Filled with
    many insecurities, she believed her bond with her daughters had diminished, which
    soon led to the birth of her next child, <b>Takasu Yuuchi</b>---a fresh start.


    Now,
    Taiga can''t go a week without hearing about what trouble her daughters were
    getting into. After countless visits to Yuri''s office, she feels helpless. All
    she can hope is that Yuuchi never turns out like them. As for Ryuuji, he seems
    to be happy with how he''s doing as a father, despite her daughters'' struggles
    to fit in. However, this bliss has left him blind to what''s happening below
    the surface.


    Whether they were truly good parents... the daughters would
    be the first to know.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 82abf587aec7f1b439a4ac0c432f2e7a, type: 2}
